codex
Implemented a self-contained Track B generalized-MinRank generator based on the paper’s affine zero-dimensional setting. [Theorem 5 and Sections 6–7](https://arxiv.org/html/1112.4411v2) establish the relevant algorithmic regime.

Key results:

- Shipping preset: `hard`, \(F_{655211}\), 64 variables.
- Inverse-generated unique witness.
- Exact finite-field verification; verifier never reads the planted answer.
- Reference sparse elimination: 6,188 operations.
- Compact Walsh route: 278 operations.
- Guess resistance: 0/200,000.
- Four adversarial attacks: each 0/8.
- Bare oracle verdict: `hardened`, with 0/3 solves at shipping.
- All currently gated checks pass.

Deliverables:

- [gen_1112_4411.py](/home/gson/gvrepo/results/1112.4411/gen_1112_4411.py)
- [selftest_report.json](/home/gson/gvrepo/results/1112.4411/selftest_report.json)
- [README.md](/home/gson/gvrepo/results/1112.4411/README.md)
- [llm_loop_transcript.jsonl](/home/gson/gvrepo/results/1112.4411/llm_loop_transcript.jsonl)
- [g9_hinted_transcript.jsonl](/home/gson/gvrepo/results/1112.4411/g9_hinted_transcript.jsonl)
- [g9_placebo_transcript.jsonl](/home/gson/gvrepo/results/1112.4411/g9_placebo_transcript.jsonl)

Caveat: the hinted and placebo diagnostics were attempted, but OpenRouter returned `403 Key limit exceeded` on every redraw, leaving both at 0 valid attempts. Their error transcripts are preserved and no model failures were inferred from them. The current repository harness also exposed two vendors rather than the four described in the task text.
